---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const title = "Payments \u2014 cDot";
const description =
  "High-throughput, low-cost global stablecoin settlement on cDot, with native on- and off-ramping.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>

<div class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>The infrastructure for identity and money movement at scale</h1>
    <p class="sub">cDot is the network designed for private payments, verified identity, programmable money, and autonomous agents.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section id="mission">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Where value is exchanged between people, businesses, and machines.</h2>
    <p class="lead">cDot is the blockchain network built for secure, private, and instant payments between any two verified parties. Using cryptographic pseudonyms of real verified identities, cDot ensures every transaction is both private and accountable.</p>
    <p class="lead">cDot is an alternative to the inefficiencies and privacy costs of traditional finance, a regulatable framework for private payments, and a purpose-built system for the future of money.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="problem">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Stablecoins enable instant, borderless, programmable transactions. Today's blockchains aren't designed for them.</h2>
    <p class="lead">Existing systems are either fully general or optimised for trading, and none were built to integrate identity with payments. Payments at scale don't just need speed and low cost — they need verifiable identity on both sides of a transaction.</p>
    <p class="lead">As AI agents increasingly transact on behalf of people and businesses, stablecoin payments also need native agent identity to remain accountable, auditable, and trusted.</p>
    <p class="lead">No single general-purpose chain can serve all these purposes. Combining decentralised identity, stablecoin payments, and agent permissions, cDot exists to close the gap.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="divider"></div>

<section id="uses">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Instant, low-cost settlement for any use case.</h2>
    <div class="uses">
      <span class="use">Global payments and payroll</span>
      <span class="use">Remittances</span>
      <span class="use">Embedded finance</span>
      <span class="use">Microtransactions</span>
      <span class="use">Machine-to-machine commerce</span>
      <span class="use">On- and off-ramping</span>
      <span class="use" title="Never lose your self custodied crypto">Asset recovery</span>
      <span class="use">Bank accounts</span>
    </div>
    <p class="lead">With real-time settlement, low fees, and no middlemen, stablecoins are as much a way to save money as a cryptocurrency.</p>
    <p class="lead">cDot's secure design and invisible cryptography means every transaction settles instantly, every participant — human or agent — is verified and accountable, while every real-world identity and transaction stays private.</p>
    <p class="lead">Transfer money, pay teams and suppliers, settle trades, and do much more on cDot.</p>
  
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
